|info = *Oraxia expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''50''' [[Energy]] to hurl an arcing cocoon sac that splatters on impact with any surface, then spreads an expanding web over {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''5 / 7 / 8 / 10''' meters, lasting for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''10 / 15 / 20 / 25''' seconds. Upon entering the web, enemies take {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''100 / 150 / 200 / 250''' {{D|Toxin}} damage with <u>'''100%'''</u> [[Status Chance]]. While expanding for <u>'''?'''</u> seconds, the web instantly traps enemies in cocoons; once the web is fully expanded, enemies walking into its radius with [[Line of Sight]] to the web's center, {{D|Slow}} down for <u>'''?'''</u> seconds then become cocooned. Cocooned enemies cannot move and become debuffed with {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''35% / 40% / 45% / 50%''' [[Damage Vulnerability]]. Up to a maximum of <u>'''3'''</u> webs can be created.
**Number of active webs are shown on the ability icon.
**The web visually expands over the horizontal plane, encircled by a radial Void energy aura.
**Webbed Embrace's ability effects occur inside an invisible sphere centered on the web, allowing Oraxia to create her webs on walls and still affect enemies below.
*'''Ability Synergy:''' Damage Vulnerability enhances the damage of {{A|Mercy's Kiss}}, {{A|Widow's Brood}} darts and Scuttler bites, and {{A|Silken Stride}}'s bonus {{D|Toxin}} damage on ranged weapons and damage explosion on kills.
*[[Nullifier Crewman|Nullifiers]] will '''not''' destroy Webbed Embrace, but instead render enemies immune to its effects while inside the Nullifier Bubble.
*Subsuming Oraxia to the [[Helminth]] will offer Webbed Embrace and its augments to be used by other Warframes.
**However, Subsumed Webbed Embrace's range is reduced to {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''6.67''' meters.
