*Cast on an open area to increase the line of sight of the web, to catch more enemies walking into its path.
*Create up to three webs in high traffic chokepoints to crowd control multiple fronts.
*Cocooned enemies receive more damage from all sources, and make for easy targets for enemy weakpoint shots,  {{A|Mercy's Kiss}} and {{A|Widow's Brood}} Scuttlers.
